---
import DocLayout from '../../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
---

<DocLayout title="Styles" description="The token reference for Farn — the concrete values you look up while building">
  <h1>Styles</h1>
  <p>
    Styles is the token reference: the concrete values — colours, type, spacing, motion — you
    look up while building. For the concepts and rationale behind them, see
    <a href="/foundations">Foundations</a>.
  </p>

  <div class="card-grid">

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/styles/color">
      <div class="card-media card-preview st-preview-color" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="color-swatch" style="background: var(--in0-void)"></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" style="background: var(--bm2-birch)"></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" style="background: var(--fo1-fern)"></div>
        <div class="color-swatch" style="background: var(--bl1-ochre)"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Color</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">The four palettes, semantic tokens, and the WCAG contrast matrix.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/styles/typography">
      <div class="card-media card-preview st-preview-type" aria-hidden="true">
        <p class="type-display-specimen">Farn</p>
        <p class="type-body-specimen">Instrument Sans · body</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Typography</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Font stacks, the Fraunces <code>opsz</code> rule, and the type scale.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/styles/spacing">
      <div class="card-media card-preview st-preview-spacing" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="spacing-bars">
          <div class="spacing-row"><div class="spacing-bar" style="width: var(--space-xs)"></div><span class="spacing-label">xs</span></div>
          <div class="spacing-row"><div class="spacing-bar" style="width: var(--space-sm)"></div><span class="spacing-label">sm</span></div>
          <div class="spacing-row"><div class="spacing-bar" style="width: var(--space-md)"></div><span class="spacing-label">md</span></div>
          <div class="spacing-row"><div class="spacing-bar" style="width: var(--space-lg)"></div><span class="spacing-label">lg</span></div>
          <div class="spacing-row"><div class="spacing-bar" style="width: var(--space-xl)"></div><span class="spacing-label">xl</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Spacing</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">The spacing scale, border radius, and z-index.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/styles/motion">
      <div class="card-media card-preview st-preview-motion" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="motion-track" role="presentation">
          <div class="motion-block"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Motion</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Duration and easing tokens with pairing guidance.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="card card-interactive card-outlined" href="/styles/icons">
      <div class="card-media card-preview st-preview-icons" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
        </svg>
        <span class="icon-size-hint">var(--space-xl)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p class="overview-card-title">Icons</p>
        <p class="overview-card-desc">Using a third-party icon set with Farn sizing and colour tokens.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

  </div>

  <p>
    For the theming system — <code>data-theme</code>, <code>data-surface</code>, and the full
    semantic token reference — see <a href="/foundations/surfaces">Foundations › Surfaces</a>.
  </p>
</DocLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Color preview ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .st-preview-color {
    padding: 0;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .color-swatch {
    flex: 1;
    height: 100%;
  }

  /* ── Typography preview ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .st-preview-type {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
  }
  .type-display-specimen {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .type-body-specimen {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* ── Spacing preview ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .spacing-bars {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    width: 100%;
  }
  .spacing-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .spacing-bar {
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-accent);
    opacity: 0.7;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .spacing-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  /* ── Motion preview ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .st-preview-motion {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .motion-track {
    width: 100%;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--color-bg-inset);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .motion-block {
    position: absolute;
    top: 4px;
    left: 4px;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--color-accent);
    animation: farn-overview-motion var(--duration-slow, 0.8s) var(--ease-out, ease-out) infinite alternate;
  }
  @keyframes farn-overview-motion {
    from { transform: translateX(0); }
    to   { transform: translateX(4.5rem); } /* 72px — roughly 1/3 of typical track width */
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .motion-block { animation: none; }
  }

  /* ── Icons preview ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .st-preview-icons {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .icon-size-hint {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }
</style>
